      "kind": "edge",
      "says": "The page's InjectableService: a bare @Inject field named config receives the registry's \"config\" entry."
    },
    {
      "id": "practice.KeyedInjectorTest#aMissingKeyKeepsTheFieldsValue",
      "kind": "edge",
      "says": "An @Inject field whose key the registry lacks, or maps to null, keeps the value it was initialised with."
    },
    {
      "id": "practice.KeyedInjectorTest#aFieldWithoutInjectIsNeverTouched",
      "kind": "edge",
      "says": "A field without @Inject keeps its value although the registry holds an entry under its name."
